The interactive game-style attraction you are looking for is **Illumination’s Villain-Con Minion Blast**, located in Minion Land on Illumination Avenue at Universal Studios Florida.

Unlike traditional sit-down rides (such as the neighboring *Despicable Me Minion Mayhem* simulator), Minion Blast is a stand-up blaster attraction set along a moving walkway. Visitors grab an "E-Liminator X" interactive blaster and test their villain skills by aiming and firing at digital targets, environmental objects, and villains on large projection screens to rack up points. Guests can also sync the attraction with the official Universal Orlando mobile app to customize their blaster settings, unlock special power-ups, track scores, and complete digital missions.

