For wood-fired pizza paired with tropical cocktails right by the water, head to the southern end of Duval Street adjacent to South Beach. 

The premier oceanfront destination in this spot is the open-air eatery at The Southernmost House (often visited as the Seaside Cafe at the Mansion, right next to the Southernmost Beach Cafe). As highlighted by [Megan Starr](w3) and [With Wonder and Whimsy](w4), visitors flock here for wood-fired artisan pies—most famously their signature lobster pizza—accompanied by tropical drinks like fresh mojitos and their take on the Pusser's Painkiller with rum, coconut cream, orange juice, and freshly ground nutmeg, all enjoyed steps from the sand.

